So I know that this is
a series about refugees

00:01:49.840 --> 00:01:52.380
and I am doing some work on refugees,

00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:54.580
but this one in particular,

00:01:55.539 --> 00:01:57.920
I'm barely, I'm not gonna
