able to continue patent

00:12:07.580 --> 00:12:08.580
without that person.

00:12:10.248 --> 00:12:12.590
So, you know, we don't
want to make a strong claim

00:12:12.590 --> 00:12:15.322
about that, but I am putting up front here

00:12:15.322 --> 00:12:16.400
that the fact that, you know,

00:12:16.400 --> 00:12:19.427
we're not coming here with saying, like,

00:12:19.427 --> 00:12:21.190
here's a perfect identification.

00:12:21.190 --> 00:12:23.810
There could be important selections.

00:12:23.810 --> 00:12:28.810
We try to show, you know, we
try to watch clean as we can,

00:12:29.440 --> 00:12:30.960
but your point is great.

00:12:30.960 --> 00:12:32.810
And, and yes, I mean,

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:35.880
most of these moves are
going to be voluntarily.

00:12:35.880 --> 00:12:36.980
- [Sanjeev] Thank you.

00:12:39.450 --> 00:12:40.283
- [Dany] I hope though

00:12:40.283 --> 00:12:42.033
that you still find cool and interesting,

00:12:42.033 --> 00:12:42.930
what we going to find,

00:12:42.930 --> 00:12:45.640
even though we do have
room for improvement

00:12:45.640 --> 00:12:47.860
in terms of identification strategy.

00:12:47.860 --> 00:12:50.240
- [Sanjeev] So at the
macro level, it's like,

