00:18:20.900 --> 00:18:23.800
the platform contains the
universe of patents granted

00:18:23.800 --> 00:18:27.943
by the USPTO from 1976 to present.

00:18:29.930 --> 00:18:34.710
That doesn't mean, I mean, we,
